[{"answer":"Sandra, I seem to remember you had some family visitors staying with you recently.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/2.mp3"},{"answer":"My brother and his family were here a couple of months ago.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I wanted to ask for your advice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got my cousin and her family visiting next month","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/6.mp3"},{"answer":"and as I don't have kids, I've no idea where to take them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/8.mp3"},{"answer":"What about accommodation?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Are they going to stay with you in your flat?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/10.mp3"},{"answer":"No, thankfully, there wouldn't be room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/11.mp3"},{"answer":"My cousin wants me to recommend a hotel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know anywhere?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I do actually.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I always recommend people stay at the King's Hotel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Where's that near?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/16.mp3"},{"answer":"It's about five minutes walk from Murray Station, so nice and central.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/17.mp3"},{"answer":"It's actually on George Street.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, I know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I think they're on quite a tight budget,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/20.mp3"},{"answer":"so how much roughly is it to stay there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/21.mp3"},{"answer":"If you book a family room, it's about £125 per night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/22.mp3"},{"answer":"My brother paid for two double rooms in the end,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and I think that was around £95 for each room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's not too bad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... so how old are your cousins' kids?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Twelve and nine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/27.mp3"},{"answer":"So I want to organise some trips while they're here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I was thinking of doing a bus tour of the city centre,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/29.mp3"},{"answer":"as none of them have been here before.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Those bus tours are quite expensive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it's better to do a walking tour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/32.mp3"},{"answer":"It gives you a much better feel for the city.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/33.mp3"},{"answer":"There's one that starts from Colton Square.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/34.mp3"},{"answer":"It takes a couple of hours and doesn't cost that much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds good, I'll look that up, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/36.mp3"},{"answer":"If the weather's nice, one thing you could do is visit the old fort.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/37.mp3"},{"answer":"You could get there by boat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/38.mp3"},{"answer":"The whole trip takes half a day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/39.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a really good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to do that myself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/41.mp3"},{"answer":"And if the weather's bad, I was thinking they could go to the science museum.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/42.mp3"},{"answer":"But maybe they could do that when I'm at work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, don't forget it's closed on Mondays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/44.mp3"},{"answer":"They're here from Saturday for four nights, so Tuesday would be best, I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... and it won't be so crowded then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Saturdays are terrible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I took my kids to the exhibition on old computers there and it was far too crowded.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I wanted to go back but it's finished now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/49.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a shame.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/50.mp3"},{"answer":"My cousin's kids would have enjoyed that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/51.mp3"},{"answer":"There's another one starting soon on space, which looks really good too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, well, I'll mention that to my cousin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you thought about where to take them to eat?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I really like all the food stalls at Clacton Market.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/55.mp3"},{"answer":"My cousin's vegetarian.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/56.mp3"},{"answer":"I know it's one of the best places for that kind of food.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Definitely, and there'll be loads of choice for the kids too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/58.mp3"},{"answer":"You need to get there quite early, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/59.mp3"},{"answer":"At the weekend, most of the stores stop serving lunch at 2.30.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Good point.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/61.mp3"},{"answer":"It's all going to need careful planning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/62.mp3"},{"answer":"My cousin said she'd love to take the kids to a show at the theatre,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/63.mp3"},{"answer":"but tickets are so expensive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/64.mp3"},{"answer":"I know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/65.mp3"},{"answer":"But you can get some good deals if you book online with bargainedtickets.com for the following day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/66.mp3"},{"answer":"On some seats, there's a 75% discount.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/68.mp3"},{"answer":"I must try and get some.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, there are lots of things you can do for free as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/70.mp3"},{"answer":"No need to spend a fortune.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Like what?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/72.mp3"},{"answer":"They're coming next month, right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, check and see if it's the same weekend as the Roots Music Festival in Blakewell Gardens.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/74.mp3"},{"answer":"ROOTS?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, check it out online.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/76.mp3"},{"answer":"It's always a family-friendly event and there's no entry charge.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/77.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds perfect.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/78.mp3"},{"answer":"And if you're in Blakewell Gardens, climb Telegraph Hill.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/79.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll be able to look right down on the port.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Everyone's always really impressed because it's so huge.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yeah, I've been meaning to do that for ages.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/82.mp3"},{"answer":"I've heard the view's amazing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, it's really worth the effort.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's given me loads of ideas, thanks so much!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-4-part-1-2025-07-21-19-58-07/85.mp3"}]
